      35→
      36→## 3. Build & Static Analysis
      37→
      38→| Check | Command | Expected Result |
      39→|-------|---------|----------------|
      40→| Build | `go build ./...` | PASS - no errors |
      41→| Vet | `go vet ./...` | PASS - no warnings |
      42→| Race Detection | `go test -race ./...` | PASS - no data races |
      43→
      44→## 4. Integration / E2E Scenarios
      45→
      46→### 4.1 E2E Screenshot Script Validation
      47→
      48→| Check | Description | Expected Result |
      49→|-------|-------------|-----------------|
      50→| `e2e-screenshot.sh` exists | Script file should exist in `snake/scripts/` | PASS - file exists and is executable |
      51→| `asciinema.sh` exists | Alternative script should exist | PASS - file exists and is executable |
      52→| `screenshots/` directory | Screenshots directory should exist | PASS - directory created with .gitkeep |
      53→
      54→### 4.2 E2E Screenshot Verification (Manual Review)
      55→
      56→The following should be verified visually from the generated screenshot:
      57→
