      62→- [ ] Screenshot filename matches pattern: `YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS-snake-gameplay.cast`
      63→
      64→## 5. Anti-Misjudgment Mechanisms
      65→
      66→| Mechanism | Purpose | Verification |
      67→|-----------|---------|--------------|
      68→| `-timeout 5m` on tests | Prevents default timeout misjudgment | PASS - explicit timeout set |
      69→| `-race` flag | Detects data races that could cause flaky failures | PASS - no races found |
      70→| Event-driven input | No goroutine lifecycle issues on restart | Verified via code review |
      71→
      72→## 6. Environment & Setup Notes
      73→
      74→### Prerequisites
      75→- Go 1.x installed
      76→- For E2E screenshots: `asciinema` (recommended) or `script` command available
      77→- Terminal with color support (24-bit color ideal for snake game)
      78→
      79→### Running Tests
      80→
      81→```bash
      82→# Full test suite with race detection
      83→cd snake && go test -timeout 5m -race ./...
      84→
      85→# Build verification
